# GraphCompare

## Import

```svelte
import { GraphCompare } from 'markgraphy';
```

## Basic usage

```svelte
<GraphCompare
  title="example"
/>
```

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `columns` | `string[]` | `—` | — |
| `rows` | `CompareRow[]` | `—` | — |
| `accent?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `palette?` | `GraphPalette` | `—` | — |
| `corner?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `class?` | `string` | `''` | — |

## Exported types

- `CompareCell`
- `CompareRow`
- `GraphCompareProps`
